Changes:
- Breaking a block will drop it as an item.
- Nearby dropped items of the same type nearby will be grouped into one (with counting).

NOTE:
Almost the entire implementation of this system is temporary and meant for testing, this is meant only for entities, as mined blocks will be sent straight to your inventory.
Also, the architecture is brute-forced and will be refactored significantly in the future. This is the only time I don't advise to understand the code, as it will be irrelevant soon.